{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Ecp",
  "description": "ECP（`qwb-data/ecp/*.yaml` 的形态）。",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "citation": {
      "description": "引用来源，至少 1 条；每条需 `title` + `doi` 或 `url`。",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/Citation"
      }
    },
    "created": {
      "description": "创建/修订时间，ISO 8601 UTC。",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "element": {
      "description": "元素符号。",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "license": {
      "description": "许可声明。",
      "$ref": "#/$defs/License"
    },
    "local_part": {
      "description": "局域部分。",
      "$ref": "#/$defs/EcpLocalPart"
    },
    "n_core_electrons": {
      "description": "芯电子数。",
      "type": "integer",
      "format": "uint32",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "name": {
      "description": "数据键名（数据目录下的标识）。",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "nonlocal_parts": {
      "description": "非局域部分，按 `l` 升序且不重复。",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/EcpNonlocalPart"
      }
    },
    "notes": {
      "description": "备注/来源说明（可选）。",
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "r_power_convention": {
      "description": "`r` 幂次约定。",
      "$ref": "#/$defs/RPowerConvention"
    },
    "sha256": {
      "description": "内容摘要（工具生成，见 [`crate::sha256`]）。",
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "version": {
      "description": "数据版本（独立 semver；§8.6 要求变更即 bump）。",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "z_eff": {
      "description": "有效核电荷 `Z_eff = Z - n_core_electrons`。",
      "type": "number",
      "format": "double"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "name",
    "version",
    "citation",
    "license",
    "created",
    "element",
    "n_core_electrons",
    "z_eff",
    "r_power_convention",
    "local_part",
    "nonlocal_parts"
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "Citation": {
      "description": "一条引用来源（§4 K1：每项 `title` + `doi`/`url`）。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "doi": {
          "description": "DOI（与 `url` 至少给一个）。",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "title": {
          "description": "文献/数据标题。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "description": "URL（与 `doi` 至少给一个）。",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "title"
      ]
    },
    "EcpLocalPart": {
      "description": "局域部分。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "description": "该数据块在来源中的标识（便于逐项核对）。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "terms": {
          "description": "项列表。",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/EcpTerm"
          }
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "terms"
      ]
    },
    "EcpNonlocalPart": {
      "description": "非局域部分（按角量子数 `l` 分组）。\n\n**语义（§8.2 的第二个陷阱）**：这些块是**相对局域通道的差分** `ΔV_l = V_l − V_L`\n（`L` = 导出里最大的 `l`，见 [`Ecp::local_part`]），不是绝对 `V_l`。EMSL/BSE 的\n`ecp_potentials` 就是这么给的，PySCF/libcint 也按这个语义算：实测\n`ECPscalar == V_local + Σ_l V_l P_l`（差 `8.9e-16`，见\n`qwb-core/crates/qwb-scf/tests/i05_ecp_oracle.rs`）。所以算子\n`V_ECP = V_L + Σ_{l<L} ΔV_l P_l`，通道那一项**不许**再减一次 `V_L` ——\n2026-11 之前就是这么错的，Zn 的 d 通道因此只剩 1/18。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "description": "该数据块在来源中的标识。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "l": {
          "description": "角量子数 `l`。",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "terms": {
          "description": "项列表。",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/EcpTerm"
          }
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "l",
        "id",
        "terms"
      ]
    },
    "EcpTerm": {
      "description": "一个 ECP 高斯项：`coefficient * r^power * exp(-exponent * r^2)`。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "coefficient": {
          "description": "系数。",
          "type": "number",
          "format": "double"
        },
        "exponent": {
          "description": "高斯指数，单位 Bohr^-2。",
          "type": "number",
          "format": "double"
        },
        "power": {
          "description": "`r` 的幂次 `n`（按 `r_power_convention` 解释）。",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "power",
        "exponent",
        "coefficient"
      ]
    },
    "License": {
      "description": "许可声明（§4 K1 / §8.6：`commercial_ok` / `redistribute_ok` 必须显式）。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "commercial_ok": {
          "description": "是否允许商用。",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "redistribute_ok": {
          "description": "是否允许再分发。",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "spdx": {
          "description": "SPDX 标识（如 `Apache-2.0`、`CC-BY-4.0`）。",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "spdx",
        "commercial_ok",
        "redistribute_ok"
      ]
    },
    "RPowerConvention": {
      "description": "`r` 幂次约定（§8.2 显式声明的陷阱）。\n\nStuttgart 系的表格常用 `r^(n-2)`，其他来源常用 `r^n`。字符差异会直接改变\n非局域项的量级，所以必须在数据里声明，由加载器统一转成内部约定。\n\n**内部约定是 `r^n`**（`qwb_scf::ecp` 把 `power` 直接当 `r` 的指数用），所以\n`r^(n-2)` 的数据在 [`Ecp::normalise`] 里把每一项的 `power` 减 2 —— 归一后的\n内部幂次因此落在 `[-2, 2]`（`r^-2 … r^2`），这正是 `qwb_scf::ecp::radial_power`\n显式覆盖的范围。\n\n# 为什么 BSE 属于 `r^(n-2)`\n\nBSE 的 `r_exponents` 值 `n` 对应的算符项是 `c r^(n-2) e^(-ζ r^2)`：\n\n* BSE 自己的 CRYSTAL 写出器在写\"完整幂次\"时做 `rexp - 2`，并注明\n  \"r exponent in CRYSTAL format is the full one: it does NOT have the r^{-2}\n  prefactor as in other formats\"（`basis_set_exchange/writers/crystal.py`）；\n* libcint/PySCF 的 ECP 块同样把 `r_exponents` 当成 `n` 去算 `r^(n-2)`\n  （实测：单个 Gauss 项 `rorder = 1` 给出的积分等于 `c r^-1 e^(-ζr^2)` 的解析值）。\n\nLANL2DZ 的局域通道正好印证：Zn 的 `-18.0`（= `n_core`）落在 `r^(1-2) = r^-1` 上，\n也就是 `-Z_core/r` 那一项。",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "表格里写的是 `r^n`（= 内部约定，加载后一定是它）。",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "r^n"
        },
        {
          "description": "表格里写的是 `r^(n-2)`（BSE 的 `r_exponents` 就是这一种）。",
          "type": "string",
          "const": "r^(n-2)"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
